Value Required IOS_VERSION ([^,\s]+)
Value PLATFORM (\S+)
Value SOFTWARE_IMAGE (\S+)
Value UPTIME (.+)

Start
  ^Cisco IOS XE Software, Version ${IOS_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^Cisco IOS Software.*Version ${IOS_VERSION},.*$$
  ^\S+\s+uptime is ${UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^System image file is ".*:${SOFTWARE_IMAGE}"\s*$$
  ^[Cc]isco\s+${PLATFORM}\s+\(.+\).*
